ard: the title in the same place, your balance in the corner, BACK on the left and the main action in gold. Menu, map, forge and battlefield are cleaner and easier to read. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46275085/0b5c2f8c0c6581e580ac9d3ab1e39e81a0a39762.png REDRAWN HE","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:54:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696434","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126340-1845383656377829","game_id":"steam-5126340","kind":"announcement","title":"RUNECAST's demo gets a new look — enter the Web Queen's lair","summary":"The rune chooses. You command. The RUNECAST demo has a new look. We have reworked its animations, interface, and battle feedback, with fixes inspired by players' reports. If you tried an earlier version, now is a good time to return. Enter the Queen's lair She descends on a thread, spins a cocoon, and calls her brood. The young spiders charge your team while the cocoon shields their mother. The Web Queen encounter has a reworked sequence in the battle scene itself, with a presentation that match","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T14:28:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377829","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126340-1843481262690516","game_id":"steam-5126340","kind":"announcement","title":"RUNECAST now speaks 7 languages — and thank you for 100 wishlists","summary":"Five new languages in the demo The RUNECAST demo is now available in Spanish, French, German, Italian and Russian, on top of Portuguese and English. Interface, tutorials, the whole Tome and the boss lines. Switch in OPTIONS → LANGUAGE; on first launch the game picks your system language. Español: la demo ya está en español. Cámbialo en AJUSTES → IDIOMA. Français : la démo est maintenant en français. Changez-le dans OPTIONS → LANGUE. Deutsch: Die Demo gibt es jetzt auf Deutsch. Umschalten unter O","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T22:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690516","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5126340-1843481262687888","game_id":"steam-5126340","kind":"announcement","title":"The Runecast is Live","summary":"The rune chooses. You command. The RUNECAST demo is available now, free, in English and Portuguese. What's in it All of Act 1: 10 waves at the Palisade, from the first goblin to the Witch. The start of Act 2: the Iron Maw, up to the Web Queen. 4 heroes (Dwarf, Archer, Healer, Rogue) and their 8 evolutions. 8 findings to equip, the rune forge and the Tome with the bestiary. What we want from you Play it and tell us what you think. Where you got stuck, what made no sense, what was too easy, what w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T03:29:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262687888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5126340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5126340":"2026-10-26T08:43:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5126340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:12Z"},"5181900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26